{"availability":"available","full":"mynaparrot/plugNmeet-server","name":"plugNmeet-server","description":"The open-source, self-hosted video conferencing software. Scalable, customizable, and with a powerful AI Meeting Agent.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Go","stars":567,"forks":120,"created":"2022-02-25T07:30:32Z","updated":"2026-10-04T03:00:11Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://www.plugnmeet.org","topics":["ai","ai-agent","communication","livekit","pion","video-chat","video-chat-meetings","video-conferencing","web-conferencing","webrtc","webrtc-call","webrtc-meetings","webrtc-video"],"demo":"https://demo.plugnmeet.com/landing.html","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T05:50:29.671Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-05T05:50:29.671Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-05T05:50:29.671Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T06:50:11.946Z","discoveredVia":[{"kind":"curated-list","name":"Awesome Selfhosted","url":"https://github.com/awesome-selfhosted/awesome-selfhosted"}],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-04T06:50:11.946Z","stars":565,"forks":120},{"at":"2026-10-05T05:50:29.671Z","stars":567,"forks":120}],"technologies":["Go"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Plug-N-Meet is a powerful, open-source web conferencing solution built on the high-performance WebRTC infrastructure of LiveKit. Designed for scalability and easy customization, Plug-N-Meet allows you to seamlessly integrate a feature-rich, self-hosted, and AI-powered video conferencing experience into any existing website, application, or system.","Have questions or ideas? Join our developer community on Discord to connect with the team and discuss your suggestions."],"features":["High-Performance & Scalable: Built with Go and leveraging the power of LiveKit, ensuring a robust and lightweight system.","Adaptive Streaming: Simulcast and Dynacast support ensures stable calls even on poor networks by intelligently managing video quality and bandwidth. Supported codecs include H264, VP8, VP9, and AV1.","Rich Collaboration Tools: Engage users with HD audio/video, screen sharing, virtual backgrounds, a collaborative whiteboard with office file support (PDF, DOCX, PPTX), shared notepad, polls, and breakout rooms.","Secure & Private Communication: Features WebRTC-based encryption by default, with optional End-to-End Encryption (E2EE) for all media and data channels, ensuring conversations remain confidential.","AI-Powered Meeting Intelligence: Turn meetings into actionable intelligence. The AI agent provides live spoken translations, real-time transcription, and automated summaries with action items, all accessible via the…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/mynaparrot/plugNmeet-server/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"b8a77dc27ae77bcfd0c6a31fa4da2d14482348773068842f911eba5f03c057ad","extractedAt":"2026-10-04T06:50:11.946Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T06:50:11.946Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Plug-N-Meet is a powerful, open-source web conferencing solution built on the high-performance WebRTC infrastructure of LiveKit. Designed for scalability and easy customization, Plug-N-Meet allows you to seamlessly integrate a feature-rich, self-hosted, and AI-powered video conferencing experience into any existing website, application, or system.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/mynaparrot/plugNmeet-server/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[{"text":"Plug-N-Meet is a powerful, open-source web conferencing solution built on the high-performance WebRTC infrastructure of LiveKit. Designed for scalability and easy customization, Plug-N-Meet allows you to seamlessly integrate a feature-rich, self-hosted, and AI-powered video conferencing experience into any existing website, application, or system.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/mynaparrot/plugNmeet-server/blob/main/README.md"}],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"b8a77dc27ae77bcfd0c6a31fa4da2d14482348773068842f911eba5f03c057ad","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/myn